THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The following are included for reproducibility and remain under their own terms:

  - Natural Earth boundary extracts under data/external/ are public domain.
    https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/
  - The Turkish General Directorate of Mapping (HGM) area workbook, boundary
    archive, derived HGM province GeoJSON, and face-level boundary ledgers are
    NOT distributed in this repository. They retain the HGM source terms, which
    describe the material as indicative rather than legally official, require
    attribution, and permit free use and distribution outside commercial
    activities. Their retrieval locations, SHA-256 identifiers and local
    derivation instructions are given in data/external/README.md so that users
    who accept the HGM terms can rebuild them.
    https://www.harita.gov.tr/urun/turkiye-mulki-idare-sinirlari/232
  - Analytical tables and figures that depend on HGM province assignment or HGM
    area denominators are authored derivative results rather than HGM source
    material, and are offered under the CC BY 4.0 grant above with HGM credited
    as an input source. Reusers who need the underlying HGM material must obtain
    it from HGM under its own terms. This statement records the rights position
    of the repository and is not legal advice.
  - The Fields of The World prediction product is distributed under CC BY 4.0
    via Source Cooperative. https://source.coop/ftw/global-data
